{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1506,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a9813029f95b4d9a9d8dfef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…幸好你不是外星人。\r\n因为…你的规划能力，\r\n简直天才到了可以征服地球的程度！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd020fd2ec7e7181b88574124928d616250c6aa9d56d438a9c2c2d40d9bb424b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9e4a1e06b602213cb9e9742",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直很期待这个时间哦！\r\n因为我的力量正在飞速增长嘛！\r\n已经兴奋得不得了了…呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "82bdc8b128dc6097b3cf972aa5e26fe8f98ca9e282548c0e93d356fb7fe71f1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:325d2b6ef0ba00b7cf5c55ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心脏因为有某人的存在，才会燃烧。\r\n如果你也这么想的话…\r\n我们能爬到更高的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07c67fe4ac72f60bb8b38d88ffe6d6fcbad23a7ab8db7656da7461e17525b533",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5330de12fc135363844b8cfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵♪我喜欢你那张脸。\r\n那是已经下定决心的表情。\r\nLook at you...so bold.",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e3f92b4bd20aad16452f11aeeef3e3a6b9b219e63ce027a957b7fefa11bd9b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ee6606823d9fb34e1e869ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家干劲十足呢…！\r\n我们也绝对不能输。地狱级的\r\n特训菜单，我可是很期待的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48578886d316cc2ff41be9b4703bd718a8fc3a748b63b30874da7a6227822214",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c030c9965eedbaf95cea540b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你会给女王最棒的赞美，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3fbdffc4cca80d36ae7f7bc233ca0dcfabcca53401295702e2008b64347e0d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:531fde7ab053652c92da5347",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挺起胸膛，partner。你可是要站在我身边的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4a63ba5729826fede3e6e2657f93bb2be2cf43c934274f4f9355c21cd23bdc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63eab2dc17eed00be1fb70ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "On the up ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "24e6a34b93e487ee9b465d236d32f55b957437a620639763190a605c12dab82b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:996ad9c9a738434b3303d75a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还要继续展翅高飞哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4587cb84fc5a03c0ef84beae83388b37e8c66975e40c7fa29c4dd26167fcb948",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1408b822416f01c1806dc903",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是勇敢之心！Ready to shine!",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d8eb8d27aab852419136c24ea393223dd0a9a23f26e48ed7764fa544b81f8ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:847662170b71731d58d96193",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为女王的，是我！\r\n因为我向这颗heart起誓过了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcdf44fe16a2765acadddb71f7edac7d48265605e406c61db175cac4dbfc65d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:430a72b781d3d30a60c78d95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我再多支持你一点吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "08000b7ee0bf874d848ffb869843ca04826c3227915ef58cbca35a63620608cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd0025f5bd5db53310bc62ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK。给你最棒的支援。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d109a998c4dec57fb068896f10b425120a0f0a38be73a81ffc5efa63ef958012",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eafeeb4d5012bda85ee1c23a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咻咻地上吧~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7234e78dbf9754b9af0a9e2c7f51fdfe53ca837c86382c504ca898f2a7b4832c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75e15d0dacaed9fd4b59ab7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噫嘻嘻♪要大获全胜喽♡\n本来我就是天才！\n找到你之后就更不用说能赢了♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "19a30e743d964590176db1e6eb535cc797349c6745909955bd19538e53db2425",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb2cb8c6a8bea4f9538ff9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发啦~",
      "source_fingerprint": "698c2cc1ffd336d58630c670458028fcab40df52e6c4a1bdcc6de96366165a71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ff3fe280fa1380ff4f8b8c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦~",
      "source_fingerprint": "464c5fdc2e39f69c3f953f52447eb178a98976c447d3dd5387c573ca3f5b5e2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c49d33ec1f84a321bc20525",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐~我们已经是亲友了吧？\n所・以・说~……我可以把课本\n放在训练员室吗？当然可以吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b6b41978a58fd166ac8e3a46d89ebc02141576a9e6f30d574d40a8e84e3af7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31541f8505deda228468fa5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要训练吗~？ \n明明好不容易才找到了爱好……啊！\n那我们先约好下次要做的事~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "522ee084d265840c0bd2b918fc85ac61557632479dba673b4044c777665659ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d3e667c01dd36176fa163fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了？ 你正月很闲吗？\n……那和我去约会吧！\n新年购物约会♡然后帮我提东西♡♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "372989975c65665f877013d99cde660fb884e0f913c35f6abc7111c59c9cf2a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1f7bb6e728b493c75636d31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然你好像很期待……但是很遗憾♡\n适合给你的情人节巧克力好像\n并没有~~才怪♡ 嘿嘿，吓到了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "510fa51eff3a9066eec5bbc23e752a4c7de8c7d78d464f34cde357feb4fa3e5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75c445029cfb1c21e71d8560",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "关于巧克力的感想吗？\n倒是也没有特意问的必要啦！\n…今年的也还是很好吃？对吧~！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecdf56dbf78086d443e5c1fd9d6e1cea8a4d8dadb6c6742c46d3ed5e3f7013c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64ac6a8960ea2ba82802cb9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶？七夕心愿条只能写一张吗？\n那就都写在一张上♡ 太天才了♪\n海外旅行还有电视出演~……",
      "source_fingerprint": "06be62b642bd2ca17cde7e87af98085f9107de0ab5b8fda1fa5f383e47621e67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a39466526fc2d4469d9676a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妖怪护士之类的变装，\n感觉超~~适合我♪\n不给糖果的话就要扎你了哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9ef2c9d52a03380698ab483f9f9e8b3d34cecf1b9f1b83276c0552389a862eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76870b1d8f7e4e7fd9920a2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节还训练也太离谱了吧！\n……好啦♡ 别唠叨了，\n去吃晚餐去吃晚餐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b71893f6741fb448e9cd8d141471b0d526e7744cd100e1ac82594782d8e67e87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f42a0a409c42820420e5cbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐~礼物呢~？\n倒也确实有收到很多……\n……但最想要的还没收到呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a05ef3a6abb05ab54f31e637915117c2bce2459975a13948bf2a567984907fda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f4f95849b16ede4ea868a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们赢啦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "a10eb280d8f16523ce34579f03ac7706113cade3608c09993a490daf3ee11b22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d768f4c0cde64abb017ede4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "房间大扫除~？扫过了扫过了♡\n因为被说了所以就……啊！\n不可以去问小心心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a64eda9665f599c90f684c8a9759a8c4453c926665b56bff6263b00e9831775a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc257416f76b7f03dbf80038",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生快~！\n呐呐，有什么想要的东西吗？\n只要有爸爸在，什么都能买给你♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "448acf92702b940fb445c1e221e7be7d08bb95f173372923aeb45788cda789ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b9f63ed199202bfdc468acc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的礼物~\n是去吃饭？还是去买衣服？\n还是说……什么？训练！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bc35b555dd4cdda68ad8175af1478919975f00a7f92dc3df44c0c629f291f4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e6667e611353f34145c5d24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的生日宴会\n也包了一艘豪华客船♪\n呐呐，要穿什么衣服去呢~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2191939cef376be2d11d62ad352effee3b7224b607d8bb8c8679e6e1a8ba11cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53caad302630f77ff0f70a8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日当天的预定完全空出来了，\n……想怎么宠我都尽管来吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a1e91054d040ebd0a40cb4780c3228525a2c5e2ac747e6abc9529be56b190e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05a912ccaddb20e4cf2836c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……诶？啊，通知？\n哦，就拜托你确认啦~",
      "source_fingerprint": "009b0d1ea253ada54f0294a746ba8e833cebd33f79918e2679702738b0bada26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3243bfa44ac1421a1b0bcf77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说是有礼物送到了！……呐呐，\n是给我的吗？是给我的吗~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfc61dfe993738ed951300e5e15ddf08885a5ae2706c30c17944a767128f64ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bc981e9172be4dcc3b063b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成恭喜~♡ 嘛！\n既然是天才马娘的担当！\n能做到也是当然♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b2d853fc5ea38270ac3e95ec948a34043c2c7c52d822391c0789bb348f8ed00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:227aca0165a1d96c61799f21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么什么？有活动吗？\n会给奖励的那种？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5801d516a1357cc0bfc49c5785129fe7c10158c7afd14f8511112dc597ac315b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5159c465f82a5b97e53a3330",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开办中~！\n……嘻嘻，\n就让你见识一下我的才能吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c9a7fe947ad988dd3902129ed78a513b15bd78b117f837544594c725778f83f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da205a51f0de8715a72f364d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇、奇怪……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ce3cb13489d35794f75c3c08573b9d4945b875f8ba4de242b85011390d70aed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:929383ba082f3dd8abacfe89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐~\n说是名鉴等级上升了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ca052e2cd0e81ebd54e1d2bc14bff4a7ad8a0f83d3aab358e639ef95bf8b3c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac6bae8d5a028d6c3cd52999",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从以前开始我就喜欢粉色♡\n书包是粉色的，\n笔盒还有抹布都是粉色的~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "119a01d7e347ef5b73f0359ecf95ceed72b1a3fd220686a4a9880fd8a271a800",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfefbc1501753cca4f1ace9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近又~有模特星探来发掘我♡\n……拒绝起来好麻烦，\n干脆答应了吧~？……变装☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aa12883236deea58102d130de68e790279d0e6d0dac5c72f7b436e783a41546",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b134000675ddd5350ad7c61e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸嘿！和太阳神前辈她们一起\n去唱了卡拉OK♡ \n经常在外面见面呢♪ 辣妹引力？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e908d45bf20b558a5ad2da4300efa966f3ca76be609a342ff6c01bdf4e04341",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa34dbb8a3a255bc5ef2f539",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可惜~~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dd8fbca0c5e6aa4040248dcf309cf555ee6d996ed1f0907b339460981a8167d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1113",
        "1003"
      ]
